<title>HONG KONG: Bankers Trust sets warrants on Paliburg.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on Paliburg.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International PLC intends to issue 650 million call warrants on shares of Paliburg Holdings Ltd, Bankers Trust said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$7.00</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1589</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  19.JUN.98</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> LISTING DATE	16.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  WITH ISSUER'S CASH OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
